Fix for table customers
Muretto never runs these. Review them and run them yourself.

  ⚠ RLS off: publicly readable
    ALTER TABLE "public"."customers" ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
    Note: Then add policies for the access you need; with RLS on and no policy, the API returns no rows.

  If you no longer need it, remove it with:
    DROP TABLE "public"."customers";
